{
  "about": "Kit parts that carry a component from the ARCS OS Design System (claude.ai/artifact/1DnaMvAFvSspGFTvh1f2wi, components/bundle.js). Each listed declaration must appear in the part's @prim block, so the kit cannot drift from the design system again. Checked by scripts/kit_primitive_sync.py --kit. Seam: the Badge component code uses a literal 4px radius, off the design system's own scale (3, 6, 10, 16); the kit uses radius-xs (3px) so DESIGN.md holds. Second seam: Badge text is 10px, under the repo's 11px functional-text floor; the kit keeps --fs-label (11px) so the floor holds. The 22px height is the outer height (border-box), as the design system renders it.",
  "parts": {
    "28-chip": {
      "component": "Badge (signal tags) and StatusBadge (.chip.status)",
      "rules": {
        ".chip": {
          "box-sizing": "border-box",
          "height": "22px",
          "padding": "0 10px",
          "border-radius": "var(--ds-r-xs)",
          "font-size": "var(--fs-label)",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "letter-spacing": "0.1em",
          "text-transform": "uppercase",
          "white-space": "nowrap"
        },
        ".chip.cyan": {
          "border-color": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--cyan) 35%, transparent)",
          "background": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--cyan) 13%, transparent)"
        },
        ".chip.green": {
          "border-color": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 35%, transparent)",
          "background": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 13%, transparent)"
        },
        ".chip.gold": {
          "border-color": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--gold) 35%, transparent)",
          "background": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--gold) 13%, transparent)"
        },
        ".chip.red": {
          "border-color": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--red) 35%, transparent)",
          "background": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--red) 13%, transparent)"
        },
        ".chip.status": {
          "gap": "5px",
          "padding": "2px 8px",
          "border-radius": "var(--ds-r-pill)",
          "font-weight": "500",
          "letter-spacing": "0"
        },
        ".chip.status::before": {
          "width": "5px",
          "height": "5px",
          "border-radius": "50%"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
